\title{bootqcc: parametric bootstrap control charts for any distribution}
\description{
Phase I limits for a quantile (or any statistic) of an arbitrary parametric
distribution via parametric bootstrap and maximum likelihood, with Monte
Carlo ARL evaluation and Phase II monitoring.
}
\section{Main functions}{

\code{\link[=bootqcc]{bootqcc()}} builds a chart, \code{\link[=arl]{arl()}} re-evaluates its run length (for example
under a parameter shift), \code{\link[=bootqcc_monitor]{bootqcc_monitor()}} applies it to new samples and
\code{\link[=bootqcc_grid]{bootqcc_grid()}} runs a simulation study over many settings.
}

